				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Start AL in a terminal\n\nUse Elixir compatible with the project's ~> 1.18 requirement and its dependencies. Run:\n\n```sh\ncd /path/to/AL-Ex\nmix deps.get\niex -S mix\n```\n\nKeep this terminal running. AL uses the checkout's persistent .mnesiastore directory. Reuse an existing AL runtime if one is already using that store; do not start competing VMs against it."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-09-04T16:04:06.548197+01:00"
					}
